      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "被发现了，真吓我一跳……\r\n是这样。我，是为了想变得像圣王同学一样而在修行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60bff31fb53dad7080e408587260e86f0f1a6bdef4e9d4cd2ebf32be2eb701c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
