    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a144e4bca26050bc47d4720",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我，一直憧憬着公主战士的强大。\r\n但当我来到学园，与圣王同学相遇后――",
      "source_fingerprint": "76f3bbace660a97c92382b2b5d2c719b27393941b613adde754731c820935df0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
