      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个，比方说圣王同学不会上楼梯一步跨两个台阶，\r\n碳酸饮料不会一口气喝完，也不会用大碗吃饭……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd77fc33fe3b8e8db02a57112d41d89f0993952f645c47ae6a0db681872daf4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
