      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个……其实完全没感觉。不知道为什么我一点也没觉得\r\n自己更接近圣王同学了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "70d11cf6465f2976b766531761efbb4a454b59df12b1a297e99795185da0089f",
